'''Retsu Kaioh''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained from the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 14.3 Update|Version 14.3]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 790
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Retsu Kaioh
|name2 = Retsu Kaioh CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Retsu Kaioh CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Retsu is intended to be a Red/Alien crowd controller, specifically tailored to [[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoths]]. However, he performs impressively even outside of his intended niche. He is capable of outranging many relevant target traits, while carrying high enough damage to play an attacking role in your lineup. If that wasn't enough, his immunity to [[Wave Attack|Waves]] even allows him usage against notoriously tricky [[:Category:Wave Attack Enemies|Wave Attackers]] such as [[Berserkory]], [[Elizabeth the LVIth]], [[Two Can]], and others.

Against Behemoths, Retsu's performance sees a noticeable spike: Even though [[Casaurian Ahirujo]] is [[Immune to Freeze]], his DPS against Red Behemoths shoots up to 19,530 at level 30; Wave Immunity allows him to comfortably outrange [[Infernal Pegasus Deonil]], who isn't Immune to Freeze; and despite the fact that [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] outranges him through its [[Long Distance]] attacks, Retsu has more than enough effective HP to tank its attacks for extended periods of time.

Overall, Retsu is a nifty unit to own. Although his [[Freeze]] rate is rather subpar, he makes up for it through his standout utility in many situations.

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Crowd-Controller}}

